    <!-- Exterior LEDs ON: a plain lit bulb.
         Colour is explicit rather than android:tint, because ic_led_off needs a dark backing
         stroke behind its slash to stay legible over live video, and a vector-level tint would
         flatten that to one colour. Both icons are drawn the same way so they stay a matched
         pair, and so the Field Guide (which renders these same drawables) matches the toolbar.

         THE ICON SHOWS STATE, NOT THE ACTION. Same convention as the IR buttons: a plain bulb
         means the lights ARE on. The state comes from the aircraft's own getLedPilotLamp, never
         from what we last asked for. -->
